## 9. PGP & GPG

| Tool | Full Name | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| **PGP** | Pretty Good Privacy | Software implementing encryption for files, emails, and digital signatures |
| **GPG** | GNU Privacy Guard | Open-source implementation of PGP |

### Common GPG Usage
```bash
gpg --gen-key                          # Generate a GPG key pair
gpg --export <key-id> > public.key     # Export public key to share
gpg --encrypt --recipient <email> file # Encrypt a file for a recipient
gpg --decrypt file.gpg                 # Decrypt a file using your private key
```

> GPG is widely used to encrypt and sign email messages. Always keep a backup of your GPG keys in a secure location.

